  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Cut the egg plants into 1-inch thick slices and brush with olive oil.",
    "Season the egg plant slices with smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Roast the egg plant slices in the oven for 30 minutes or until tender.",
    "Prepare the sushi rice according to the package instructions.",
    "Mix the lime juice and chopped cilantro into the sushi rice.",
    "Shape the sushi rice into nigiri shapes.",
    "Top each nigiri with a roasted egg plant slice and a sprinkle of grated queso fresco.",
    "Wrap each nigiri with a nori sheet.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
